{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495810/extras/5da73d480a5e14e7bd387db1d86345d1.poster.avif?t=1773861653\" width=614 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495810/extras/5da73d480a5e14e7bd387db1d86345d1.webm?t=1773861653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495810/extras/5da73d480a5e14e7bd387db1d86345d1.mp4?t=1773861653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wet Passion is a unique puzzle game designed for relaxation and enjoyment. With over 100 unique levels, you will have an exciting journey where you will move the blocks to restore the original images. Each new level presents you with a new challenge and brings you even more pleasure from solving tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495810/extras/27062661c061ce08c53ed331164725a5.poster.avif?t=1773861653\" width=614 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495810/extras/27062661c061ce08c53ed331164725a5.webm?t=1773861653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495810/extras/27062661c061ce08c53ed331164725a5.mp4?t=1773861653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 100 unique levels</strong>: Each level presents a new challenge where you need to move blocks to restore the original images.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging puzzle-solving process</strong>: Constant changes in level difficulty provide players with variety and enjoyment from solving puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A wealth of captivating images</strong>: Restoring images with each new level brings joy and relaxation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perfect for rest and relaxation</strong>: The game is designed with relaxation in mind, allowing players to unwind and enjoy the process without stress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simplicity and accessibility</strong>: Intuitive controls and clear mechanics make the game accessible to all players, regardless of experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495810/extras/d8c4e5b7ecf714ce5ab1a488d6421f44.poster.avif?t=1773861653\" width=614 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495810/extras/d8c4e5b7ecf714ce5ab1a488d6421f44.webm?t=1773861653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495810/extras/d8c4e5b7ecf714ce5ab1a488d6421f44.mp4?t=1773861653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Step of Pleasure","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3495810/a9d8ecca685cb6d4e6e5ea28c51f94eb72fca611.jpg"},{"name":"Warming Up","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3495810/5cc79d4dba4bc6e7519c21886fe5d66f16cca651.jpg"},{"name":"Piece by Piece, Pleasure by Pleasure","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3495810/af034d53c301e1a78d3a249fab8c54b8b9d67462.jpg"},{"name":"Breaking Boundaries","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3495810/8695ab567c34f395831b12dfa1021665e97a49e2.jpg"},{"name":"Serenity Mastery",